WEBVTT

1
00:00:10.834 --> 00:00:30.974
Poppy tried to park again.

2
00:00:30.975 --> 00:00:33.256
She backed up.

3
00:00:33.257 --> 00:00:35.195
She turned.

4
00:00:35.196 --> 00:00:37.741
Her wheel hit the curb.

5
00:00:37.742 --> 00:00:40.669
"Ugh!" cried Poppy.

6
00:00:40.670 --> 00:00:44.712
"I still can't do this!"

7
00:00:44.713 --> 00:00:49.720
Zippy laughed.

8
00:00:49.721 --> 00:00:57.092
Poppy glared at Zippy.

9
00:00:57.093 --> 00:01:00.629
"Can you park?" she asked.

10
00:01:00.630 --> 00:01:04.375
"Race cars don't park," said Zippy.

11
00:01:04.376 --> 00:01:09.153
"We go fast!"

12
00:01:09.154 --> 00:01:13.769
Eddy drove over to Poppy.

13
00:01:13.770 --> 00:01:17.895
"You just need to practice," he said.

14
00:01:17.896 --> 00:01:21.505
"But we have a test," said Poppy.

15
00:01:21.506 --> 00:01:24.883
"I'm going to fail it!"

16
00:01:24.884 --> 00:01:30.021
"No, you won't," said Eddy.

17
00:01:30.022 --> 00:01:33.005
"I'll help you practice."

18
00:01:33.006 --> 00:01:35.502
Poppy smiled.

19
00:01:35.503 --> 00:01:38.269
"Really?" she asked.

20
00:01:38.270 --> 00:01:43.616
"Of course," said Eddy.

21
00:01:43.617 --> 00:01:47.413
"Story time!" called Ms. Fender.

22
00:01:47.414 --> 00:01:51.139
Everyone raced over to the teacher.

23
00:01:51.140 --> 00:01:54.822
"We'll practice during recess," said Eddy.

24
00:01:54.823 --> 00:01:58.186
"Thanks, Eddy!" said Poppy.

25
00:01:58.187 --> 00:02:02.745
"You're a great friend!"
